    "content": "<!-- wp:mbn-theme/service {\"heroHeading\":\"Motorcycle Suspension Services\",\"heroBody\":\"We provide Expert Level Suspension services to the everyday rider. With TBT RACING we can get your off road bike dialed in just for you. Our DA Motorsports team also works with Harley Davidson riders to add comfort and performance to their riding experience.\",\"whyChooseHeading\":\"<span>A Wide-Range</span> of Suspension Tuning & Upgrade Services\",\"whyChooseSubheading\":\"At DA Motorsports we are not a one size fits all shop. We provide each rider with a spec that works for them and their specific riding style. From basic service to full revalve using years of testing and R&D. We are an official TBT RACING shop and have the full support of industry leading test riders .\",\"whyChooseItems\":[{\"title\":\"Off-Road Motorcycle Suspension Tuning\",\"text\":\"Our tuning services include custom settings developed for each rider based on their weight, ability and terrain.\",\"tag\":\"Tuning\",\"iconImageId\":130,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-Off-Road-tuning.png\"},{\"title\":\"Suspension Maintenance\",\"text\":\"Routine maintenance is required to keep your suspension operating at its full potential. We provide chassis and suspension maintenance including greasing, oil change, and seal replacement services.\",\"tag\":\"Maintenance\",\"iconImageId\":133,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-Suspension-Maintenance.png\"},{\"title\":\"Suspension Rebuilds\",\"text\":\"Rebuilds are more in depth then basic maintenance. All hard parts and wear items will be replaced and brought back to new condition.\",\"tag\":\"REBUILD\",\"iconImageId\":136,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-Suspension-Rebuilds-1.png\"},{\"title\":\"Suspension maintenance/ upgrades\",\"text\":\"Harley Davidson recommends inspecting your suspension and steering systems every 10,000 miles, at 20,000 miles it is recommended that the suspension is disassembled , inspected and oil be changed.\",\"tag\":\"HARLEY DAVIDSON\",\"iconImageId\":132,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-Suspension-harley.png\"},{\"title\":\"Setup & Adjustments\",\"text\":\"Basic suspension setup is critical to the proper operation of any motorcycle. We provide basic setup of SAG and external adjusters get a baseline of performance and handling. This applies to any Off-Road or street bike.\",\"iconImageId\":131,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-Setup-Adjustments.png\",\"tag\":\"SETUP\"},{\"title\":\"Advanced Suspension Support\",\"text\":\"For our racers, we also provide trackside suspension tuning and support. This service is available to anyone wanting to take their settings to the next level.\",\"iconImageId\":129,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-Advanced-Suspension-Support.png\",\"tag\":\"OTHERS\"}],\"servicesBackgroundImageId\":116,\"servicesBackgroundImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/why-choose-bg.png\",\"servicesHeading\":\"From Consultation to <br/><span>Ride-Ready</span>\",\"servicesSubheading\":\"At DA-Motorsports, we walk you through every step of our suspension tuning process\",\"serviceItems\":[{\"title\":\"Consultation\",\"text\":\"In depth one on one to discover the rider’s specific ability, terrain and needs for their motorcycle.\",\"iconImageId\":154,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/icon-consultation-1.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Custom Tuning\",\"text\":\"Settings developed specifically for each rider’s personal preferences.\",\"iconImageId\":140,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/icon-custom-tinting.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Installation\",\"text\":\"Complete shop services that provide removal, installation and setup.\",\"iconImageId\":141,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/icon-installation.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Testing & Fine Tuning\",\"text\":\"Trackside or roadside tuning services are available for the rider who wants to take their settings to the next level.\",\"iconImageId\":138,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/icon-testing.svg\"}],\"services2Heading\":\"Why Choose <span>DA - Motorsports</span>\",\"services2Subheading\":\"Leading Motorcycle and dirt bike suspension shop for real riders. \",\"service2Items\":[{\"title\":\"Factory- Level Suspension\",\"text\":\"We provide the local level riders with access to Expert Race suspension settings. Through years of R&D and track testing, TBT RACING has been able to provide some of the best settings in the industry to all levels of racers from AMA Supercross to Local C class riders.\",\"iconImageId\":144,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-factory-level.png\"},{\"title\":\"Backed by TBT RACING\",\"text\":\"All of our Off-Road settings are developed by TBT RACING HQ through actual test riders of all skillsets. Weeks to months of testing go into developing the settings we are providing our customers to ensure that they are satisfied with the results.\",\"iconImageId\":143,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-backed-by-tbt.png\"},{\"title\":\"Harley Davidson Suspension\",\"text\":\"Our Harley Davidson suspension packages provide the rider with a more comfortable, stable, safer motorcycle. If you are touring the country or racing your bike we have a setup that will work for you.\",\"iconImageId\":145,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-herley-davidson.png\"},{\"title\":\"98% Satisfaction Rating\",\"text\":\"We take pride in our products and services. Currently we have a 98% satisfaction rating from our customers on the FIRST setup of their motorcycle. That doesn’t mean we stop there. If you are not satisfied with the setup of the bike, we work with you to further tune the suspension and strive for 100% satisfaction.\",\"iconImageId\":142,\"iconImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-98-satisfaction.png\"}],\"cta1Heading\":\"Not sure where to start?\",\"cta1Subheading\":\"Tell us about your bike and riding style. We'll recommend the right suspension service.\",\"cta1BackgroundImageId\":137,\"cta1BackgroundImageUrl\":\"https://mysite.dev.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/img-cta-services-bg.jpg\",\"testimonialSubheading\":\"Here's what your fellow riders have to say about DA-Motorsports.\"} /-->"
}